{"page":130,"w":7029,"h":11508,"lines":[{"x":0.36104512994682803,"w":0.32304038010634384,"y":0.86185515833211335,"h":0.02186577187644112,"text":"Revelation 3: 14-20","conf":1},{"w":0.25439193032004614,"text":"December 8, 1940","y":0.81349470773597288,"h":0.025626864698198082,"x":0.3965570060798711,"conf":1},{"x":0.14014254226686748,"text":"\"And to the angel of the church in Laodicea write: \"The words","conf":1,"y":0.7775297620642454,"w":0.79334912981305805,"h":0.020435354066273503},{"h":0.021911913440340935,"text":"of the Amen, the faithful and true witness, the beginning of","conf":1,"x":0.11401427622278137,"y":0.75570436552063591,"w":0.8218526964063767},{"y":0.73982558105864493,"text":"God's creation.","x":0.11401425181950883,"w":0.19477434282179004,"conf":1,"h":0.015988372621082103},{"w":0.79097386149616988,"text":"\"'I know your works; you are neither cold nor hot. Would","y":0.71800595201902317,"x":0.1401425163421765,"h":0.018912652182200507,"conf":1},{"conf":1,"x":0.11401426519324981,"w":0.81710211023107737,"h":0.020389211556268161,"text":"that you were cold or hot! So, because you are lukewarm, and","y":0.69618055527919265},{"w":0.8196271425717836,"conf":1,"text":"neither cold nor hot, I will spew you out of my mouth. For you","h":0.021128240085783512,"x":0.11393213538810996,"y":0.67676235159502074},{"text":"say, I am rich, I have prospered, and I need nothing; not knowing","conf":1,"x":0.11163895231087162,"y":0.65697674433463504,"h":0.02184270014838563,"w":0.81947742808948865},{"x":0.11401426327116997,"w":0.81947742808948865,"h":0.02036613982821267,"conf":1,"text":"that you are wretched, pitiable, poor, blind, and naked. There-","y":0.63662790741599273},{"x":0.11401427235872873,"conf":1,"y":0.61773255856424858,"text":"fore I counsel you to buy from me gold refined by fire, that you","w":0.81710211023107759,"h":0.020412282338218013},{"text":"may be rich, and white garments to clothe you and to keep the","w":0.81710211023107737,"h":0.018970329610128345,"conf":1,"y":0.59883720983705147,"x":0.11401427138598816},{"h":0.021923449304368736,"y":0.57703488423548632,"conf":1,"text":"shame of your nakedness from being seen, and salve to anoint","w":0.82185269640637681,"x":0.11163898178493488},{"h":0.019097222222222321,"y":0.55803571457593648,"x":0.11401427138598816,"w":0.81710211023107737,"conf":1,"text":"your eyes, that you may see. Those whom I love, I reprove and"},{"w":0.81947742808948865,"conf":1,"text":"chasten; so be zealous and repent. Behold, I stand at the door","h":0.018953026287139352,"y":0.53918650820720448,"x":0.11401426327116997},{"text":"and knock; if any one hears my voice and opens the door, I will","y":0.51736111145768415,"h":0.020429585661206895,"w":0.81947742808948865,"conf":1,"x":0.11401426165596809},{"conf":1,"text":"come in to him and eat with him, and he with me.'\"","y":0.49851190513048016,"w":0.67933491298130588,"h":0.020383443151201552,"x":0.11401425548084346},{"conf":1,"x":0.11401426190537432,"y":0.4593023260061091,"w":0.81947742808948865,"h":0.020360372369251589,"text":"THe season of Advent proclaims the coming of Christ to"},{"h":0.021836931743319132,"conf":1,"w":0.82422801426478798,"text":"judge the world, and on the second Sunday in Advent,","x":0.106888359922238,"y":0.4360119051803516},{"y":0.41269841298122156,"w":0.81947742808948865,"h":0.021894610117352165,"text":"according to ancient Church use, we are to think of the","conf":1,"x":0.11401426190537432},{"h":0.020429586607312422,"w":0.81947742808948865,"y":0.39236111076351654,"text":"theme of divine judgment. The solemn summons of the","x":0.11401426190537432,"conf":1},{"text":"text: \"Behold, I stand at the door and knock\"","conf":1,"x":0.11163896497115829,"y":0.36918604683744105,"w":0.64845602852957585,"h":0.023255813689458948},{"x":0.75236902053395605,"conf":1,"w":0.18136594202611356,"text":", also invites","y":0.36943510865237783,"h":0.021893062288799059},{"x":0.11401425994575438,"y":0.34593023258214317,"conf":1,"w":0.81947742808948854,"text":"us to such thoughts. It admonishes us to be prepared for the","h":0.021877306794363394},{"x":0.11163896218873577,"h":0.021825396825396748,"y":0.32266865038710579,"text":"coming of the Lord, and the preceding verses suggest how","conf":1,"w":0.82185269640637681},{"conf":1,"text":"we should acquire this spirit of vigilant readiness. They are","x":0.11163897954027945,"y":0.30084325386024291,"h":0.02183116428435794,"w":0.82185269640637681},{"w":0.82217927412553271,"conf":1,"x":0.11145760679803199,"y":0.27815274525897715,"h":0.025089691555689186,"text":"introduced by the remarkable word: \"The words of the"},{"conf":1,"y":0.25570436535625329,"h":0.021911913440341046,"w":0.82185269640637681,"x":0.11163896659151805,"text":"Amen, the faithful and true witness, the beginning of God's"},{"text":"creation.\" This means that the words with which we are","x":0.11156956308160222,"y":0.23530303952967047,"w":0.82201979996322039,"h":0.019516619424971404,"conf":1},{"text":"challenged, John the seer has heard in the spirit as the","w":0.82209758015422085,"y":0.20883812046679828,"conf":1,"h":0.023827556579832043,"x":0.11152068466153001},{"conf":1,"text":"words of Christ, the words of the \"Amen\"","y":0.18750000036457293,"h":0.023313492063492092,"w":0.5985747993766487,"x":0.11163896971785132},{"conf":1,"x":0.70071258778193812,"w":0.23277909415108811,"y":0.18750000024302749,"h":0.020348836505223789,"text":"'. Amen signifies"},{"conf":1,"h":0.021825396825396859,"y":0.1656746032051053,"w":0.82422801426478787,"x":0.1116389570303139,"text":"validity: what is unshakably true. Hence we are to hear"},{"w":0.82185269640637693,"conf":1,"x":0.11163897646031117,"y":0.14236111136947416,"h":0.021883074253324475,"text":"these words as the solid abidingly true message of Him in"},{"text":"whom God Himself became for us the incarnate Word,","conf":1,"w":0.8244838466891995,"y":0.11769576148447991,"x":0.11153271584175289,"h":0.023801525433858273},{"text":"a living and true summons.","conf":1,"w":0.37529690234692065,"x":0.11163895718758488,"y":0.09883720985785327,"h":0.020458424848223467},{"y":0.071220931022645151,"conf":1,"text":"134","x":0.49643705397208432,"w":0.049881235345617558,"h":0.01744185932098874}]}